At half past ten, I am finally tired.
I get up from the sofa.
First I go to my bedroom.
I take off my thick sweater.
I go into the bathroom.
There I wash myself.
I also brush my teeth.
I put on my pajamas.
Then I go into the kitchen one more time.
I drink a glass of water.
I turn off the light in the flat.
It is dark now.
I go to bed.
My bed is very comfortable.
I close my eyes.
I fall asleep very quickly.
